      "risk_review": {
        "status": "complete",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-33",
        "notes": "Independently checked Definition and steps 1.1, 1.2, 2.1 against def-subgroup, def-coset, def-group-action and induced feature actions. Equal cosets give gprime=g h0; multiplication by h0 permutes H, proving representative independence for action and maxima. H contains e; H and U are finite nonempty where maxima occur. H={e}, H=G finite, zero/constant features and channelwise evaluation are valid. Infinite H is allowed for restriction/action, never for finite max pooling. No normality or AC is assumed. Cohen–Welling §§6.2–6.3 equations 14–17 agree with right-neighborhood and left-action conventions. Reader/refuter report no findings; no defect or missing prerequisite confirmed."
