        "notes": "Checked all three verification steps and all five current supplier interfaces. C4/D4 have four/eight distinct matrices by supplier determinant/distinctness calculation, while translations keep full groups infinite. Applied theorem only with its finite-support/absolute-convergence condition (F5), never from a finite group assumption. Independently computed delta0 star delta_e1=delta_-e1, rotation fixes delta0 and moves -e1 to -e2; evaluation at -e1 distinguishes outputs. Reflections are indices in the point group, not orientation-preserving transformations; reader F1/reference terminology correction is accepted without changing the example statement. Cohen–Welling §§4.2–4.4, §5 eq.9 and §6.1 eqs.10–12 agree. Zero filters or symmetric filters do not contradict the existential fixed-filter witness. No AC, citation mismatch or missing prerequisite; reader/refuter findings empty."
